00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:43.720
were covered in cuts from the grapevines.

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:45.759
Later,

00:17:46.559 --> 00:17:48.720
Lin Xiaomei transformed into Lin Wanmei,

00:17:49.839 --> 00:17:52.039
and I went from Huang Meixiang to Wan Niang.

00:17:53.319 --> 00:17:54.119
Looking at it now,

00:17:54.839 --> 00:17:56.720
there's no trace of who we used to be.

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:00.799
I've spent all these years scheming to climb up.

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:02.559
I can't even remember

00:18:02.559 --> 00:18:04.400
how many men's beds I've been in.

00:18:05.079 --> 00:18:06.480
Or how many lies I've told.

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:09.119
I'm tired.

00:18:09.680 --> 00:18:10.480
Wanmei.

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:14.440
I want to leave this place.

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:16.759
Go to a place where no one knows Huang Meixiang,

00:18:17.079 --> 00:18:18.920
or Wan Niang.

00:18:19.920 --> 00:18:22.119
You won't have to sleep with those men anymore.

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:24.119
You won't have to help me hurt people anymore.

00:18:24.519 --> 00:18:26.039
From now on, anything you don't want to do,

00:18:26.039 --> 00:18:27.160
you don't have to do it.

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:29.880
I just want you

00:18:30.319 --> 00:18:31.839
to stay by my side.

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:34.359
You know...

00:18:35.720 --> 00:18:37.400
As long as I stay by your side,

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:39.400
I won't refuse your requests.

00:18:40.559 --> 00:18:42.039
Even if you don't ask,

00:18:42.880 --> 00:18:44.079
I could never turn a blind eye

00:18:44.079 --> 00:18:45.319
to your struggles.

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:06.920
Have a seat first.

00:19:19.119 --> 00:19:20.359
Book a flight for me.

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:23.759
Once Wan Niang is discharged, send her away.

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:26.839
You don't need to tell me where she goes.

00:19:26.920 --> 00:19:27.720
Okay.

00:19:34.200 --> 00:19:35.519
I got my phone fixed the other day.

00:19:36.039 --> 00:19:36.960
After recovering the data,

00:19:37.079 --> 00:19:38.000
I found this.

00:19:40.640 --> 00:19:42.799
I never sent you this message.

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:48.240
Didn't you ask me to meet you?

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:03.519
What are you doing?

00:20:04.079 --> 00:20:05.680
I saw you were asleep, Wanmei.

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:06.880
I was worried you'd drop your phone.

00:20:06.920 --> 00:20:08.359
So I was just setting it aside for you.

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:12.000
Turns out Luo Xia works for her too.

00:20:13.079 --> 00:20:13.960
It seems

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:16.079
they started plotting this long ago.

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:18.720
Fine.

00:20:20.039 --> 00:20:21.119
If that's how it is,

00:20:22.559 --> 00:20:24.599
then I'll make her experience

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:26.960
what it's like to lose someone important.

00:20:52.920 --> 00:20:53.720
Hello, everyone.

00:20:54.519 --> 00:20:55.680
I'm Lin Wanmei.

00:20:57.279 --> 00:20:58.079
Recently,

00:20:59.039 --> 00:21:00.839
there are many rumors saying

00:21:01.640 --> 00:21:03.599
that I'm the mastermind behind Gufeng's

00:21:03.599 --> 00:21:04.799
power-for-sex deal.

00:21:06.039 --> 00:21:07.799
As the daughter-in-law of the Cheng family,

00:21:08.680 --> 00:21:10.200
I may seem glamorous on the outside,

00:21:10.880 --> 00:21:12.440
but I actually walk on thin ice.

00:21:13.039 --> 00:21:14.160
There are some things

00:21:15.759 --> 00:21:17.400
that I'm powerless to change.

00:21:18.519 --> 00:21:19.279
However,

00:21:20.119 --> 00:21:21.799
I shouldn't have feared their power.

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:24.160
I should have stepped forward sooner.

00:21:24.519 --> 00:21:25.319
That way,

00:21:25.920 --> 00:21:28.279
fewer girls would have fallen victim.

00:21:29.319 --> 00:21:30.440
It's my fault.

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:33.960
I'm sorry.

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:39.079
These past few days,

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:41.799
every night

00:21:42.359 --> 00:21:43.200
when I close my eyes,

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:45.880
I hear the cries of those victimized girls.

00:21:48.119 --> 00:21:51.039
I suffer the torment of my conscience day and night.

00:21:51.680 --> 00:21:52.599
As a result,

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:54.880
I was diagnosed with depression,

00:21:57.240 --> 00:21:58.920
severe depression.

00:22:07.680 --> 00:22:08.480
Here,

00:22:09.200 --> 00:22:11.599
I beg everyone to give me another chance.

00:22:11.839 --> 00:22:13.680
I will prove with my actions that

00:22:14.039 --> 00:22:15.960
even if I lose everything,

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:18.039
I will stand up for those victimized girls

00:22:18.039 --> 00:22:19.160
and get them justice.

00:22:19.920 --> 00:22:21.279
Shameless.

00:22:23.519 --> 00:22:25.599
Staging such a farce

00:22:25.599 --> 00:22:27.000
to exonerate herself.

00:22:27.039 --> 00:22:28.359
She's throwing the Cheng family

00:22:29.240 --> 00:22:31.720
and Gufeng into the fire!

00:22:33.359 --> 00:22:34.119
I had no idea

00:22:34.119 --> 00:22:35.359
that Mrs. Lin

00:22:35.359 --> 00:22:36.599
had depression.

00:22:38.519 --> 00:22:40.079
With her status and methods,

00:22:40.160 --> 00:22:41.000
getting a fake medical certificate

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:41.920
is a piece of cake.

00:22:43.200 --> 00:22:44.680
How scheming.

00:22:45.279 --> 00:22:46.079
Now,

00:22:46.640 --> 00:22:48.279
no matter how we explain it,

00:22:48.440 --> 00:22:49.880
it'll only make things worse.

00:22:50.319 --> 00:22:51.640
Others will just assume

00:22:52.119 --> 00:22:54.519
we're using our power to oppress her.

00:22:54.920 --> 00:22:56.599
Grandma makes a good point.

00:22:57.400 --> 00:22:58.359
Recently,

00:22:58.359 --> 00:23:00.000
the company has been struggling,

00:23:00.559 --> 00:23:02.880
and Aunt Lin pulls this stunt at such a critical moment.

00:23:07.759 --> 00:23:09.200
As for her dirty deeds,

00:23:10.279 --> 00:23:11.200
trying to shift the blame

00:23:11.319 --> 00:23:12.680
onto our Cheng family

00:23:12.759 --> 00:23:14.039
and Gufeng

00:23:15.599 --> 00:23:16.880
won't be that easy.

00:23:18.599 --> 00:23:19.119
Exactly,

00:23:19.119 --> 00:23:19.839
Grandma.

00:23:31.200 --> 00:23:32.759
The recent events at the company...

00:23:33.519 --> 00:23:34.799
I'm sure everyone has heard.

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:39.000
President An.

00:23:39.519 --> 00:23:41.559
We were also deceived by Lin Wanmei.

00:23:42.000 --> 00:23:42.960
As for holding people accountable,

00:23:43.119 --> 00:23:44.359
I won't say any more on it.

00:23:44.759 --> 00:23:46.160
I hope that from now on,

00:23:46.519 --> 00:23:47.799
you will all lead by example,

00:23:47.799 --> 00:23:49.400
maintain Gufeng Group's image,

00:23:49.559 --> 00:23:51.599
and prevent such incidents from happening again.

00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:56.640
Cheng An, on what grounds are you suspending me?

00:23:59.119 --> 00:24:01.200
Your suspension was a unanimous decision by senior management.

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:02.720
Lin Wanmei,

00:24:03.559 --> 00:24:05.920
your involvement in this power-for-sex deal scandal

00:24:06.079 --> 00:24:08.119
has severely damaged Gufeng Group's image.

00:24:08.599 --> 00:24:10.480
This has absolutely nothing to do with me!

00:24:10.759 --> 00:24:12.200
I've already clarified that!

00:24:12.319 --> 00:24:13.799
You're just settling a personal vendetta.

00:24:13.799 --> 00:24:14.839
Your duties

00:24:15.160 --> 00:24:16.160
will be taken over by Sang Luo.

00:24:18.480 --> 00:24:19.759
This is also Old Madam's wish.

00:24:23.759 --> 00:24:24.480
This incident,

00:24:24.559 --> 00:24:25.880
after all, has blown up quite a bit.

00:24:26.559 --> 00:24:27.960
The company's image comes first.

00:24:27.960 --> 00:24:28.480
Yeah.

00:24:28.599 --> 00:24:29.519
Yeah, President Lin.

00:24:29.960 --> 00:24:30.559
Just consider it

00:24:30.640 --> 00:24:31.359
taking a vacation.

00:24:33.200 --> 00:24:34.000
Take some time to relax.

00:24:34.160 --> 00:24:34.960
Fine.

00:24:36.039 --> 00:24:37.039
You're all just great.

00:24:44.839 --> 00:24:46.319
Why is she back?

00:24:48.599 --> 00:24:49.359
Right now,

00:24:49.480 --> 00:24:51.279
only President An and Director Sang are left in charge.

00:24:51.400 --> 00:24:52.599
They're both part of the Cheng family.

00:24:53.079 --> 00:24:53.960
Tell me,

00:24:54.279 --> 00:24:56.559
who will the company ultimately go to?

00:24:56.720 --> 00:24:57.559
Probably President An.

00:24:57.680 --> 00:24:58.440
He's young and promising.

00:24:58.440 --> 00:24:59.359
And highly capable.

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:02.079
But seeing Old Madam's attitude toward President An,

00:25:02.400 --> 00:25:03.880
sometimes I really wonder

00:25:03.880 --> 00:25:05.319
if President An is truly Old Madam's

00:25:05.319 --> 00:25:06.480
biological son.

00:25:06.640 --> 00:25:07.480
Anyway, none of this is

00:25:07.480 --> 00:25:08.519
anything we should worry about.

00:25:09.240 --> 00:25:10.559
Good thing President Lin is gone.

00:25:10.559 --> 00:25:12.039
With such a massive scandal,

00:25:12.240 --> 00:25:13.119
I'm embarrassed to even say

00:25:13.119 --> 00:25:14.440
I'm an employee of Gufeng Group.

00:25:32.039 --> 00:25:33.160
From now on,

00:25:33.799 --> 00:25:36.920
if anyone else questions Sang Luo's identity,

00:25:37.920 --> 00:25:39.519
I will definitely

00:25:39.880 --> 00:25:41.079
show no mercy.

00:25:41.240 --> 00:25:41.640
Oh, right.

00:25:41.640 --> 00:25:42.519
And as for you...

00:25:43.240 --> 00:25:43.799
You bastard!

00:25:43.799 --> 00:25:44.680
What right do you have to stay in the Cheng family?

00:25:45.160 --> 00:25:45.960
You filthy bastard!

00:25:45.960 --> 00:25:46.720
She's my mother!

00:25:46.759 --> 00:25:47.519
Don't talk nonsense!

00:25:49.039 --> 00:25:50.680
Given Old Madam's attitude toward President An,

00:25:51.119 --> 00:25:52.319
sometimes I really wonder

00:25:52.559 --> 00:25:53.799
if President An is actually Old Madam's

00:25:53.799 --> 00:25:54.960
biological son.

00:25:57.880 --> 00:25:58.680
What's wrong?

00:25:59.480 --> 00:26:00.680
Did you have a nightmare?

00:26:11.400 --> 00:26:12.880
I had a beautiful dream